; color: #64748b; line-height: 18px;\">\n                Neem contact op met ons team via <a href=\"mailto:info@printmy3d.work\" style=\"color: #0f766e; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;\">info@printmy3d.work</a>.\n              </p>\n              <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 16px;\">\n                &copy; Print My 3D &bull; Precisie Additive Manufacturing &bull; Rotterdam, NL\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n        </table>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</body>\n</html>");

